    <string name="settings_bt_fine_scroll">Smooth scroll over Bluetooth (advanced)</string>
    <string name="settings_bt_fine_scroll_note">Smooth scroll and zoom, like a precision mouse. If Windows does not accept them, whole steps are used. After changing it you must remove the phone in Windows and pair it again: Windows caches the mouse description. Turn it off only if some PC misbehaves.</string>
    <string name="settings_bt_interval">Bluetooth interval (advanced)</string>
    <string name="settings_bt_note">Over Bluetooth, the trackpad, zoom, gesture mode and the widget panel with media, volume and your buttons work: their actions are set up on this phone (Gesture mode → Bluetooth actions; Widgets → Bluetooth buttons). Opening programs, the toolbox and widgets with a sliding volume need MyMouse on the PC (USB). The interval is how often movement is sent: fewer ms = smoother pointer and more traffic (8 ms is fine; raise it to 12–16 if you notice accumulated lag). The trackpad shows the real interval between reports, not a ping.</string>
