    <string name="settings_keyboard">Keyboard</string>
    <string name="settings_keyboard_note">It opens with the Keyboard widget, a 4-finger double tap or Vol+ ×2 (and closes with 🖱, Back or Vol+ ×2). It sends real keys, so Ctrl+C, Alt+Tab, Win+Shift+S… work. \"Automatic\" uses the PC layout over USB and the text typing layout over Bluetooth. Over USB, Windows does not allow injecting Ctrl+Alt+Del (over Bluetooth it does). Key repeat while held is done by the phone over USB; over Bluetooth, Windows does it.</string>
